<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Gigglegram</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7fa;
      }
      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .welcome-icon {
        font-size: 60px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
        color: #333333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .content h2 {
        color: #667eea;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .content p {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #555555;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .features {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .features h3 {
        color: #667eea;
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .features ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .features li {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555555;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #e7f3ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .info-box p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #0c5aa6;
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888888;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #667eea;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #e9ecef;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .highlight {
        background-color: #fff3cd;
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="welcome-icon">🎉</div>
        <h1>Gigglegram</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Welcome to Gigglegram!</h2>

        <p>Hello <strong><%= name || 'there' %></strong>,</p>

        <p>
          We're thrilled to have you join the Gigglegram community! Your account
          has been successfully created and you're all set to start your journey
          with us.
        </p>

        <div style="text-align: center">
          <a href="<%= homeUrl %>" class="cta-button">Get Started</a>
        </div>

        <div class="features">
          <h3>🚀 What You Can Do Now:</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Connect with friends and share your moments</li>
            <li>Explore amazing content from our community</li>
            <li>Customize your profile and make it uniquely yours</li>
            <li>Join conversations and discover new interests</li>
            <li>Stay updated with real-time notifications</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="info-box">
          <p>
            <strong>💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Complete your profile to get the most
            out of Gigglegram and help others discover you!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #888888">
          If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is here
          to help. Feel free to reach out anytime!
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #888888">
          <strong>Need help getting started?</strong> Check out our
          <a href="#" style="color: #667eea">Help Center</a> or
          <a href="#" style="color: #667eea">Community Guidelines</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message from Gigglegram.</p>
        <p>
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Gigglegram. All rights reserved.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="#">Terms of Service</a> |
          <a href="#">Contact Support</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
